node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
.turbo
**/.turbo
# Local build output. The image builds its own; copying a stale one in would
# mean shipping whatever happened to be on the machine that ran docker build.
dist
**/dist
coverage
**/coverage
.git
.github
*.md
.env
.env.*
playwright-report
test-results

# Patch-apply debris from merge resolution (rejected hunks / snapshot patches).
# The builder stage does `COPY . .` — keep these out of the image.
*.rej
**/*.rej
*.patch
**/*.patch
